{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t西九文化區管理局董事局主席陳智思表示，西九文化設施例如博物館、表演場所等已落成，但商業部分未建好，所以出現收支虧損，形容是時差問題。<br/>\n<br/>\n他又表示，香港能透過策展的方式，讓觀眾欣賞中國文化，是香港的特殊之處。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.299965+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:49:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T22:42:39.090901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:44.335569+00:00","content_hash":"de08a39b1b85d960f07079af53d1e9b548fce4ce214868bd0947d4ab7495ea24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}